    "azure": {
      "notes": "CAVEAT: Azure is image references, not stencils. shape=mxgraph.azure2.* does not exist. Sidebar-Azure2.js has 70 occurrences of image=img/lib/azure2 and zero of shape=mxgraph.azure2. The path resolves relative to the draw.io webapp root and works in web, desktop and headless export with no local asset. A bad path renders as an empty box with a broken-image placeholder, exit 0. The same file name appears under several categories (App_Services.svg is in compute/, app_services/ and containers/); any renders, pick the semantically right one.",
      "styleTemplate": "image;aspect=fixed;html=1;points=[];align=center;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;image=<IMAGE_PATH>;",
      "styleTemplateNote": "fontColor=#000000 added: draw.io never writes its implicit label colour to the file, a dark-mode viewer inverts the absent value to white, and the validator errors on any labelled cell with no fontColor. 21:1 on white.",
