    "gcp": {
      "notes": "CAVEAT: GCP has no single good library. gcp3 is the current clean colour set but is INCOMPLETE at 45 names total, with no Pub/Sub, no load balancer, no Firestore and no Bigtable. The gaps are filled from the legacy 2018 mxgraph.gcp.* stencils, which render as a monochrome outline hexagon with a faint glyph and therefore look visibly different from gcp3 icons on the same page. That is by design, matching draw.io's own legacy palette. gcp2 and gcpicons embed each icon as an inline base64 data-URI SVG rather than a named shape and are unusable for generation, do not attempt them.",
